    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "The value Attribute"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We have already used the value attribute in our previous examples."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The value attribute sets an initial value for elements such as <input>, <option> and <button>."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here's an example:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<form>\n2\n3  <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter email.\" value=\"john@example.com\"><br>\n4  <input type=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\">\n5\n6</form>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Browser Output"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "alt": "",
      "src": "data:image/png;base64,"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here, the initial value of the email field is already set to john@example.com."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "By the way, the value attribute overrides the placeholder attribute in our example."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": "How does it work?"
    },
